{
  "id": 8867218620615,
  "title": "Softball Bedding Set for Softball Lover Heart Love Ball Sports Theme",
  "handle": "softball-bedding-set-for-softball-lover-heart-love-ball-sports-theme",
  "body_html": "<p>Embrace your passion for softball with this vibrant Softball Comforter Set from Jeminise, designed for ultimate comfort and style. Perfect for softball players, fans, and lovers, this bedding set adds a dynamic and relaxing feel to any room.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Meaningful Theme:</strong> Show your support for softball with a spirited design that celebrates the courage and dedication of the game.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Soft &amp; Smooth Material:</strong> Crafted from 100% brushed microfiber polyester (360 gsm) for an ultra-soft, smooth, and durable feel that is fade-resistant.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Breathable Comfort:</strong> Microfiber material is cool and breathable, offering a comfortable sleep experience even more durable than cotton.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Offered in Twin, Full, Queen, and King to perfectly fit your bed.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Included Components:</strong> This set includes a stylish comforter to complete your bedding ensemble.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Designed for convenience, this comforter set is machine washable and dries quickly; tumble dry low.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Vibrant Design:</strong> Features a unique softball pattern and bright teal and yellow colors to create a relaxing and wonderful mood in your bedroom.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Comforter Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>70% Cotton, 30% Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Color</th>\n<td>Softball Design 05</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Sport</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Sport</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Basketball Player</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>Comforter</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>2 text inputs</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Twin 68\"x90\"(173cm*218cm), Full 79\"x90\"(200cm*230cm), Queen 90x90\"(228cm*228cm), King 104\"x90\"(228cm*264cm)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Recommended Uses for Product</th>\n<td>Napping, Reading, Travel</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>Fall, Spring, Summer</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Thread Count</th>\n<td>360</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
